      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip accent\">Coding</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Start here</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Go · C++ · Java · Python</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>From C to interview languages: Go, C++, Java, Python toolkit</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">You have written hash tables, ring buffers and red-black tree users in C. In an interview you have 45 minutes and no time to write them again. This page maps each C structure to the container in Go, C++, Java and Python, shows the exact calls to memorise, and lists the traps (defaults, overflow, comparators, strings) that cost candidates the round.</p>\n"
